s handled and audited?"],["P",{},"If a grader disagrees with the AI model confidence score, an expert override can be entered. Overrides require the Station Admin PIN and record the reason, preserving both the original AI output and the grader override for audit purposes."]],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"Which cameras and scales are supported?"],["P",{},"TunaEye supports device cameras, USB industrial cameras, and webcams via standard WebRTC, along with serial/Bluetooth digital weighing scales up to 200kg."]]],["BUTTON",{"class":"site-text-link"},"View all questions & answers ",["svg",{"width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"1.6","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round"}]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"scroll-reveal "},["SECTION",{"class":"site-cta"},["SPAN",{"class":"site-kicker"},"Ready for the Grading Floor?"],["H2",{},"Turn every yellowfin tuna sample into clear, connected evidence."],["P",{},"Start grading now or explore the full platform capabilities in your browser."],["DIV",{"class":"site-actions"},["BUTTON",{"class":"site-button site-button--primary"},"Start Grading ",["svg",{"width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"1.6","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round"}]]],["BUTTON",{"class":"site-button"},"Explore Features"]]]]],["FOOTER",{"class":"site-footer"},["DIV",{},["SPAN",{"class":"site-logo"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4178/tunaeye-logo.svg","src":"/tunaeye-logo.svg","alt":""}],["STRONG",{},"Tuna",["SPAN",{},"Eye"]]],["P",{},"Evidence-first yellowfin tuna visual grading platform built for connected ports, buying stations, and processing facilities."]],["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Explore"],["BUTTON",{},"Home"],["BUTTON",{},"Features"],["BUTTON",{},"Team"],["BUTTON",{},"FAQ"]],["DIV",{},["S